#import "../defs.typ": *


Throughout this chapter, unnamed constants $C$ may change from line to line but
do not hide dependence on $n$, $alpha$, $p$, or $q$.
// They may depend on fixed problem parameters and may absorb fixed powers of
// $a^(-1)$. Any dependence on $n$, $alpha$, $p$, or $q$ is displayed explicitly
// or appears as an argument of a named quantity. Named constants follow the same
// convention: fixed problem factors may be absorbed only when they are not being
// tracked explicitly in the surrounding display.
